# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository, regardless of OS.
# The server runs in a Linux Docker container and shell scripts inside
# the deploy/ variants must keep LF; mixing CRLF in the repo would break
# them on rebuild. Windows contributors keep CRLF in their working tree
# if their local core.autocrlf is true; git converts on checkout/commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff2 binary
